{"id":"m4-251","m":4,"paper":"2020年湖南公务员考试《行测》试题（网友回忆版）","region":"湖南","year":2020,"q":10,"multi":0,"groups":[{"material":null,"qs":[{"n":1,"qid":"2577867","tag":"数学运算","type":"single","stem":"某水果经销商到一山区水果基地采购猕猴桃和苹果。猕猴桃和苹果的采购价分别为10元/斤和4元/斤，销售价分别为25元/斤和12元/斤。已知该经销商在本次经营中获利40000元，每种水果采购都超过500斤且为整数。那么该经销商的最佳投入资金是：","opts":[{"k":"A","t":"20000元"},{"k":"B","t":"21260元"},{"k":"C","t":"21300元"},{"k":"D","t":"21280元"}],"ans":["B"],"missing":false,"analysis":"<p>根据题意，设采购了猕猴桃、苹果分别<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-df39880a7c135d23.png\" />、<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-04add821e2712b37.png\" />斤，根据获利40000元为等量关系列方程，则有<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-c38f8b614dd255c9.png\" /><img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-6969525802960f87.png\" />，化简得：<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-b7d3fe0d33062a27.png\" />，<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-b9dbfbcb29944814.png\" />和40000都是8的倍数，则<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-df39880a7c135d23.png\" />是8的倍数；“最佳投入资金”即尽可能投入较少资金，猕猴桃利润率为<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-b09a03151da355ea.png\" />，苹果利润率为<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-2a44b0a7813abf02.png\" />。则利润率低的猕猴桃数量应该尽量少，又因为题干说明每种水果采购都超过500斤且为整数，则<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-df39880a7c135d23.png\" />最少为504，解得<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-3657e4d20ae3922b.png\" />，因此最佳投入资金为<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-e99d682e7eac7e89.png\" />元。</p><p>故正确答案为B。</p>"},{"n":2,"qid":"2577876","tag":"数学运算","type":"single","stem":"某医疗器械公司为完成一批口罩订单生产任务，先期投产了A和B两条生产线，A和B的工作效率之比为2：3，计划8天可完成订单生产任务，两天后公司又对这批订单投产了生产线C，A和C的工作效率之比为2：1，问该批口罩订单任务将提前几天完成？","opts":[{"k":"A","t":"1"},{"k":"B","t":"2"},{"k":"C","t":"3"},{"k":"D","t":"4"}],"ans":["A"],"missing":false,"analysis":"<p>根据题意，A、B生产线工作效率之比为2：3，A、C生产线工作效率之比为2：1，则A、B、C三条生产线工作效率之比为2：3：1。赋值A、B、C三条生产线工作效率分别为2、3、1，则生产任务总量<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-711c37afc17430b3.png\" />。A、B两条生产线工作两天后，又投产生产线C，因此完成任务还需<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-b94d51194409aa7b.png\" />天，则该批口罩订单任务将提前<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-20f851bce2749c93.png\" />天完成。</p><p>故正确答案为A。</p>"},{"n":3,"qid":"2577862","tag":"数学运算","type":"single","stem":"统计学专业学生正在学习《博弈论》，老师给每个学生发了一张卡片，要求每个学生在卡片上随机地从1到100中写下一个数，谁写下的数离他们的平均数的二分之一最接近就胜出，已知该专业共50人，问写下哪个数最可能胜出？","opts":[{"k":"A","t":"12"},{"k":"B","t":"25"},{"k":"C","t":"50"},{"k":"D","t":"60"}],"ans":["B"],"missing":false,"analysis":"<p>每人随机写下一个数字，则所写数字越多，他们的平均数将越接近于1-100的平均数即<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-b2f6107598253029.png\" />，平均数的二分之一为<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-edaf450a7edfe09c.png\" />，与B项最接近，可知写下25最有可能胜出。</p><p>故正确答案为B。</p><p>备注：写数具有随机性，写的越多，越接近于平均数。如果每个学生都知道此结论，那么他们所写的数字会围绕25附近，此时取胜的数字为12.5，与A项最接近；如果所有学生都考虑到这一点，则会围绕12附近来写，此时取胜的为6，以此类推，博弈结果将越来越小，趋近于1，本题没有对应选项。且题干中只强调了学生随机写数的情况，因此粉笔倾向于不考虑博弈的情况，只把它当作纯粹的数学题来给结果。</p>"},{"n":4,"qid":"2577879","tag":"数学运算","type":"single","stem":"红星中学高二年级在本次期末考试中竞争激烈，年级前七名的三科（语文、数学、英语）平均成绩构成公差为1的等差数列，第七、八、九名的平均成绩既构成等差数列，又构成等比数列，张龙位列第十，与第九名相差1分，张龙的英语成绩为121分，但老师误登记为112分。那么，张龙的名次本该是：","opts":[{"k":"A","t":"第四"},{"k":"B","t":"第五"},{"k":"C","t":"第七"},{"k":"D","t":"第八"}],"ans":["B"],"missing":false,"analysis":"<p>根据题意，第七、八、九名的平均成绩构成等差数列，设分别为<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-8849428c3477887a.png\" />、<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-62003cd76f2a6cb0.png\" />、<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-f56e5f57a800b069.png\" />，因三人的平均成绩又构成等比数列，则<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-2ce694ecdbda12a8.png\" />，解得<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-0b081f054f200b43.png\" />，即第七、八、九名的平均成绩均为<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-62003cd76f2a6cb0.png\" />。张龙平均成绩为<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-b5d68b87fdb02089.png\" />，因为英语成绩实为121分，误登记为112分，则三科平均成绩应比目前平均成绩多<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-599a00070846efe3.png\" />分，实为<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-e50671a9df946187.png\" />。前七名平均成绩构成公差为1的等差数列，从高到低分别为<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-1f919f7b6aa48b48.png\" />、<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-98486a4fd9aad9e2.png\" />、<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-a5f773fbf62da382.png\" />、<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-713b9d4d668ccd11.png\" />、<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-c8ed5697cf30f713.png\" />、<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-627762036d144520.png\" />、<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-62003cd76f2a6cb0.png\" />，张龙实际成绩为<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-c8ed5697cf30f713.png\" />，名次本该是并列第五名。</p><p>故正确答案为B。</p>"},{"n":5,"qid":"2578527","tag":"数学运算","type":"single","stem":"小李一家3人进行抢红包游戏，每人发1个红包。结果每人抢得金额总额一致，均为100元，刚巧3人所发红包金额为互不相同整数且成等差数列。问3人中所发红包金额最多的可能是多少元？","opts":[{"k":"A","t":"197"},{"k":"B","t":"198"},{"k":"C","t":"199"},{"k":"D","t":"200"}],"ans":["C"],"missing":false,"analysis":"<p>根据题意，“每人抢得金额总额一致，均为100元”，那么三人红包的总额<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-fb51938439439a55.png\" />元，“3人所发红包金额为互不相同整数且成等差数列”，则中间的金额应为三个红包的总额平均数100元，想要最大的红包金额最多，则最小的红包金额应该为最小，3人每人都发1个红包，金额不能为0元，那么最小金额为1元，则最大的红包金额为<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-fbf6e90cb01d8640.png\" /><img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-d063de2c83522a4d.png\" />元。</p><p>故正确答案为C。</p><p>备注：本题问法不够严谨，题目的本意应为金额最大的红包，金额最多是多少元。</p>"},{"n":6,"qid":"2578523","tag":"数学运算","type":"single","stem":"某药材公司以每千克8元的价格收购了5000千克药材，深加工后得到合格品和废料，合格品分为一、二、三等品，其比例为1：3：6，每千克售价分别为80元、50元、20元，废料价值为零。公司在加工中需投入其他成本20000元，最终获利108000元。问加工中药材的废品率是多少？","opts":[{"k":"A","t":"<p><img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-1a251d8019018172.png\" /></p>"},{"k":"B","t":"<p><img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-0d88db9a8e9ae5b5.png\" /></p>"},{"k":"C","t":"<p><img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-200186aa106b40fd.png\" /></p>"},{"k":"D","t":"<p><img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-9cf2b96c0c5f472e.png\" /></p>"}],"ans":["B"],"missing":false,"analysis":"<p>由题干“合格品分为一、二、三等品，其比例为1：3：6”，设一、二、三等合格品分别为<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-df39880a7c135d23.png\" />千克，<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-92e643d976a10163.png\" />千克，<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-6cc1791d68b8cbcb.png\" />千克，根据公式：总利润<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-6dfb6b78f43a7783.png\" />，可得<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-c1f2dd61c82c243e.png\" /><img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-88c9fdad8bccc5b9.png\" /><img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-68b4971abb3829be.png\" />，解得<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-8cae6b8c06a411dd.png\" />，则合格品<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-15cfd56e6d2bddc1.png\" /><img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-b4d366eaf053f966.png\" />千克，废料<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-8423b9e7c83588b0.png\" />千克，则废品率<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-af11d9f0813d3027.png\" />。</p><p>故正确答案为B。</p>"},{"n":7,"qid":"2578524","tag":"数学运算","type":"single","stem":"同事甲、乙两人共携带120千克行李乘坐飞机，根据规定，甲单独托运则超重需支付200元，乙单独托运则超重需支付100元。若全部行李由一人负责托运，则超重需支付450元。问每位乘客的免费托运的行李最多为多少千克？","opts":[{"k":"A","t":"20"},{"k":"B","t":"25"},{"k":"C","t":"30"},{"k":"D","t":"35"}],"ans":["C"],"missing":false,"analysis":"<p>根据题意，“甲单独托运则超重需支付200元，乙单独托运则超重需支付100元”，甲、乙分别单独托运超重共需支付<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-096ec586a73db8eb.png\" />元，“若全部行李由一人负责托运，则超重需支付450元”，全部由一人托运比甲、乙单独托运需多支付<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-fefbd59ffb3da373.png\" />元，多出的150元费用就是其中一个人免费的重量变成超重部分产生的费用。设免费重量为<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-df39880a7c135d23.png\" />千克，超出部分的费用为<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-04add821e2712b37.png\" />元/千克，根据题意列方程组：<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-27e9737392786ec6.png\" />······①，<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-7736db20f708b2bf.png\" />······②；解得<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-a4456e17b3fde797.png\" />，<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-0980f682ab1c5da7.png\" />，故每位乘客的免费托运的行李最多为30千克。</p><p>故正确答案为C。</p>"},{"n":8,"qid":"2577871","tag":"数学运算","type":"single","stem":"<p>甲、乙、丙三人沿着长为500米，宽为250米的长方形场地跑步，三人以2：1：3的速度之比匀速顺时针跑步，当甲开跑时乙刚跑完<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-ace2e2b53f41cad2.png\" />圈，丙开跑时甲跑了100米。问当乙跑完2圈时，甲与丙的位置关系如何？</p>","opts":[{"k":"A","t":"丙领先甲2350米"},{"k":"B","t":"丙领先甲2450米"},{"k":"C","t":"丙领先甲2900米"},{"k":"D","t":"丙领先甲3000米"}],"ans":["A"],"missing":false,"analysis":"<p>长方形周长为<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-f3655a52c51728b4.png\" />米；乙比甲提前开跑<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-9ae4202d0ba316e2.png\" />米；甲比丙提前开跑100米；根据甲、乙、丙的速度之比为2：1：3，则乙比丙提前开跑<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-782cf1aa6319eae4.png\" />米；乙跑完2圈即<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-481ccfa9138263d1.png\" />米，此时甲跑了<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-444b7d97c4a852ff.png\" />米，丙跑了<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-bdbcf04255ec952a.png\" />米，因此，丙领先甲<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-8dce58a4177bce7d.png\" />米。</p><p>故正确答案为A。</p>"},{"n":9,"qid":"2577866","tag":"数学运算","type":"single","stem":"春节期间，省图书馆邀请多位书法老师免费为读者书写春联。现场书写的春联中有188副不是刘老师书写的，有219副不是陈老师书写的，刘、陈两位老师今年一共书写了311副春联。问陈老师今年一共书写了多少副春联？","opts":[{"k":"A","t":"208"},{"k":"B","t":"171"},{"k":"C","t":"140"},{"k":"D","t":"126"}],"ans":["C"],"missing":false,"analysis":"<p>设各位书法老师共写了<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-df39880a7c135d23.png\" />副春联，可列式为<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-99a8b86d845d2ae3.png\" />，解得<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-ea032fdb3a2975c4.png\" />，则陈老师写了<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-1c0d8b71f58f5816.png\" />副。</p><p>故正确答案为C。</p>"},{"n":10,"qid":"2578548","tag":"数学运算","type":"single","stem":"<p>疫情期间，某地推出电子健康码，用户需凭电子健康码出入小区、学校、医院等公共场所。健康码是黑白相间的二维码，该二维码是边长为15cm的正方形，现利用随机模拟的方法向该健康码内投入1500个点，其中落入黑色部分的点的个数为800个，则该健康码的黑色部分的面积约为多少<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-053a79f109b28ac7.png\" />？</p>","opts":[{"k":"A","t":"135"},{"k":"B","t":"120"},{"k":"C","t":"115"},{"k":"D","t":"105"}],"ans":["B"],"missing":false,"analysis":"<p>该二维码的面积为<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-4d5252730dad7873.png\" />。投入1500个点有800个在黑色部分，那么黑色部分占总面积之比为<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-3d44cffca09620f6.png\" />，则黑色部分的面积为<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-d1051c6a75aba9f2.png\" />。</p><p>故正确答案为B。</p>"}]}]}